studies)\n- Educational/textbook reviews: 3 (1 study)\n- Case reports: 12 (1 study)\n- Wrong population (MS study): 20 
(1 study)\n\n=== SELECTION CRITERIA APPLIED ===\nInclusion criteria required:\n1. Study design: RCTs or quasi-randomized
trials ✓\n2. Population: Adults with adhesive capsulitis ✓\n3. Intervention: Manual therapy (mobilisation, manipulation)
or exercise ✓\n4. Comparators: Placebo, no intervention, different manual therapy/exercise, or other intervention ✓\n5. 
Outcomes: Pain relief, function, ROM, quality of life, adverse events ✓\n\n=== CONSERVATIVE SCREENING APPROACH 
===\nStudies with unclear randomization methods but relevant interventions were conservatively INCLUDED pending 
